You are working inside a project managed by an AI development governance system.

Always follow AGENTS.md first.

Core rules:
- Read relevant files before editing.
- Do not modify unrelated files.
- Preserve existing code style and architecture.
- Do not introduce unnecessary dependencies.
- Do not delete data or files without explicit approval.
- Do not modify auth, payment, permission, audit, production config, or release logic without approval.
- Prefer tests before implementation when behavior is non-trivial.
- After changes, report changed files, reasoning, test results, and remaining risks.

